 {"comment": "The seventh run: the Display page again, on a canvas that holds what the sixth run meant to. A chunk fill writes the document's stored numbers, which are Oklab, so the hot band is an Oklab lightness of 1.5 and the patch beyond the screen a green of chroma 0.36, which neither sRGB nor Display P3 holds. A Thick Impasto stroke gives the Relief rows paint height to light. The View transform rows are picked by the label the dropdown draws, and the right pen button bound to the eyedropper is held while the tip clicks, which is the gesture the binding serves."},
